# Computes the resolved transitive label closure of every required portable
# backend target, so the Python check below can catch a platform dependency
# reached through several layers of `deps` -- something the per-BUILD-file
# text scan in check-portable-closure.py cannot see, since that scan only
# looks at each target's own immediate BUILD-file text.
